Changes in this repository (the "strateu" line of work) add and tune an engine path for
Kolibri-1 (Qwen3-family Mixture-of-Experts, 50 layers x 384 experts), including:
  * a chunked prefill carrying the routed experts through a CPU pool over a pinned table,
  * a bounded VRAM residency cache for hot experts with the remainder computed in place,
  * router tiling, transposed-KV attention and fused residual/norm kernels,
  * measurement harnesses (oracle, PF checksums, KL vs llama.cpp, 100K needle audit).

Upstream commits are preserved in this history so the derivation is auditable.
